---
import Base from "~/layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "~/components/landing/Header.astro";
import Footer from "~/components/landing/Footer.astro";
---

<Base
	title="About — Modfolio Axiom"
	description="Applied Science & Engineering. Axiom의 미션, 도메인, 그리고 생태계."
>
	<Header />
	<main id="main">
		<section class="about-hero">
			<span class="about-hero__label">About</span>
			<h1 class="about-hero__title">Modfolio Axiom</h1>
			<p class="about-hero__subtitle">Applied Science & Engineering</p>
		</section>

		<section class="about-mission">
			<div class="about-mission__inner">
				<span class="section-label">Mission</span>
				<div class="about-mission__content">
					<h2 class="about-mission__heading">
						Where precision meets discovery
					</h2>
					<div class="about-mission__text">
						<p>
							Axiom은 산업의 가장 어려운 문제에 기술로
							답합니다. 방위, 보안, 의료, 모빌리티, 에너지,
							양자 기술 — 여섯 개 핵심 도메인에서 각각
							독립적인 서비스를 구축합니다.
						</p>
						<p>
							우리가 추구하는 것은 기술 자체의 과시가
							아닙니다. 국방 지휘관이 전장을 더 빠르게
							파악하고, 의료진이 환자 데이터를 끊김 없이
							확인하며, 셔틀 탑승자가 정확한 도착 시간을 알
							수 있는 것 — 현장의 구체적인 문제를 해결하는
							것이 Axiom의 출발점이자 목적지입니다.
						</p>
						<p>
							각 도메인의 서비스는 독립적으로 설계되고
							운영됩니다. 방위 시스템의 보안 요건과 모빌리티
							서비스의 실시간 요건은 근본적으로 다르기
							때문입니다. 그러나 데이터를 정밀하게 다루고,
							신뢰할 수 있는 시스템을 만들고, 사용자에게
							실질적 가치를 전달한다는 원칙은 모든 도메인에서
							동일합니다.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-domains">
			<div class="about-domains__inner">
				<span class="section-label">Domains</span>
				<h2 class="about-domains__heading">Six core domains</h2>
				<div class="about-domains__grid">
					<a href="/defense" class="domain-card">
						<span class="domain-card__number">01</span>
						<h3 class="domain-card__name">
							Defense & Aerospace
						</h3>
						<p class="domain-card__desc">
							방위 시스템, 위성 통신, 항공우주 기술
						</p>
					</a>
					<a href="/cybersecurity" class="domain-card">
						<span class="domain-card__number">02</span>
						<h3 class="domain-card__name">Cybersecurity</h3>
						<p class="domain-card__desc">
							위협 탐지, 암호화 기술, 보안 인프라
						</p>
					</a>
					<a href="/medical" class="domain-card">
						<span class="domain-card__number">03</span>
						<h3 class="domain-card__name">
							Medical Technology
						</h3>
						<p class="domain-card__desc">
							의료 기기, 바이오센서, 임상 데이터 플랫폼
						</p>
					</a>
					<a href="/mobility" class="domain-card">
						<span class="domain-card__number">04</span>
						<h3 class="domain-card__name">
							Mobility & Logistics
						</h3>
						<p class="domain-card__desc">
							자율주행, 실시간 추적, 물류 최적화
						</p>
					</a>
					<a href="/energy" class="domain-card">
						<span class="domain-card__number">05</span>
						<h3 class="domain-card__name">
							Energy & Materials
						</h3>
						<p class="domain-card__desc">
							신재생 에너지, 배터리, 신소재 기술
						</p>
					</a>
					<a href="/quantum" class="domain-card">
						<span class="domain-card__number">06</span>
						<h3 class="domain-card__name">Quantum & AI</h3>
						<p class="domain-card__desc">
							양자 컴퓨팅, 고급 AI 연산, 차세대 알고리즘
						</p>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-service">
			<div class="about-service__inner">
				<span class="section-label">Current Service</span>
				<div class="about-service__content">
					<a
						href="https://amberstella.com"
						class="service-card"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener"
					>
						<div class="service-card__header">
							<h3 class="service-card__name">
								Amberstella
							</h3>
							<span class="badge badge--active"
								>Active</span
							>
						</div>
						<p class="service-card__domain">
							Mobility & Logistics
						</p>
						<p class="service-card__desc">
							실시간 셔틀 위치 추적과 탑승 관리 서비스.
							탑승자에게 정확한 도착 시간을 알려주고, 운행
							데이터를 분석하여 노선과 배차를 지속적으로
							개선합니다.
						</p>
						<span class="service-card__arrow">&rarr;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				<p class="about-service__note">
					Axiom은 여섯 개 도메인에서 새로운 서비스를 지속적으로
					준비하고 있습니다.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-ecosystem">
			<div class="about-ecosystem__inner">
				<span class="section-label">Modfolio Universe</span>
				<div class="about-ecosystem__content">
					<h2 class="about-ecosystem__heading">
						Part of something larger
					</h2>
					<p class="about-ecosystem__desc">
						Axiom은 Modfolio Universe 생태계의 기술 · 모빌리티
						그룹입니다. 15개 이상의 독립 서비스로 구성된 생태계
						안에서 각 그룹은 고유한 영역을 담당합니다.
					</p>
					<div class="about-ecosystem__grid">
						<a
							href="https://works.modfolio.io"
							class="ecosystem-card"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener"
						>
							<h3 class="ecosystem-card__name">
								Modfolio Works
							</h3>
							<p class="ecosystem-card__desc">
								교육 그룹. 학원 CRM, AI 학습 도구.
							</p>
						</a>
						<a
							href="https://ls.modfolio.io"
							class="ecosystem-card"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener"
						>
							<h3 class="ecosystem-card__name">
								Modfolio LS
							</h3>
							<p class="ecosystem-card__desc">
								라이프스타일 그룹. 여행, 자기 관리 도구.
							</p>
						</a>
						<a
							href="https://studio.modfolio.io"
							class="ecosystem-card"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener"
						>
							<h3 class="ecosystem-card__name">
								Modfolio Studio
							</h3>
							<p class="ecosystem-card__desc">
								크리에이티브 그룹. 문서, 오디오 변환.
							</p>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-cta">
			<a
				href="https://nexus.modfolio.io"
				class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Explore Portal</a
			>
		</section>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Base>

<style>
	/* ── Hero ── */
	.about-hero {
		min-height: 60vh;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		text-align: center;
		padding-top: 80px;
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
	}

	.about-hero__label {
		font-family: var(--font-code);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
	}

	.about-hero__title {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-4xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: var(--leading-tight);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
		background: var(--accent-gradient-text);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-clip: text;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
	}

	.about-hero__subtitle {
		font-family: var(--font-code);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-accent);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
	}

	/* ── Mission ── */
	.about-mission {
		padding-block: var(--space-12);
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-mission::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: linear-gradient(
			90deg,
			transparent,
			var(--color-border-default) 20%,
			var(--color-border-accent) 50%,
			var(--color-border-default) 80%,
			transparent
		);
	}

	.about-mission__inner {
		max-width: var(--content-max-width);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.about-mission__heading {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: var(--leading-snug);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
	}

	.about-mission__text {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-5);
		max-width: var(--measure);
	}

	.about-mission__text p {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
	}

	/* ── Domains ── */
	.about-domains {
		padding-block: var(--space-12);
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-domains::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: linear-gradient(
			90deg,
			transparent,
			var(--color-border-default) 20%,
			var(--color-border-accent) 50%,
			var(--color-border-default) 80%,
			transparent
		);
	}

	.about-domains__inner {
		max-width: var(--content-max-width);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.about-domains__heading {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: var(--leading-snug);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
	}

	.about-domains__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: var(--space-5);
	}

	.domain-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-3);
		background: var(--card-bg);
		border: var(--card-border);
		border-radius: var(--card-radius);
		padding: var(--card-padding);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition:
			border-color var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			box-shadow var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
	}

	.domain-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-border-accent);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
		background: var(--color-surface-2);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.domain-card__number {
		font-family: var(--font-code);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-accent);
		opacity: 0.4;
	}

	.domain-card__name {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
	}

	.domain-card__desc {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
	}

	/* ── Current Service ── */
	.about-service {
		padding-block: var(--space-12);
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-service::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: linear-gradient(
			90deg,
			transparent,
			var(--color-border-default) 20%,
			var(--color-border-accent) 50%,
			var(--color-border-default) 80%,
			transparent
		);
	}

	.about-service__inner {
		max-width: var(--content-max-width);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.service-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-3);
		background: var(--card-bg);
		border: var(--card-border);
		border-radius: var(--card-radius);
		padding: var(--card-padding);
		text-decoration: none;
		max-width: 480px;
		transition:
			border-color var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			box-shadow var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
	}

	.service-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-border-accent);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
		background: var(--color-surface-2);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.service-card__header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}

	.service-card__name {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
	}

	.service-card__domain {
		font-family: var(--font-code);
		font-size: var(--text-xs);
		color: var(--color-text-accent);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.service-card__desc {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
	}

	.service-card__arrow {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-accent);
		transition: transform var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out);
	}

	.service-card:hover .service-card__arrow {
		transform: translateX(var(--space-2));
	}

	.about-service__note {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		font-style: italic;
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	/* ── Ecosystem ── */
	.about-ecosystem {
		padding-block: var(--space-12);
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-ecosystem::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: linear-gradient(
			90deg,
			transparent,
			var(--color-border-default) 20%,
			var(--color-border-accent) 50%,
			var(--color-border-default) 80%,
			transparent
		);
	}

	.about-ecosystem__inner {
		max-width: var(--content-max-width);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.about-ecosystem__heading {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: var(--leading-snug);
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
	}

	.about-ecosystem__desc {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
		max-width: var(--measure);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
	}

	.about-ecosystem__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: var(--space-5);
	}

	.ecosystem-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-3);
		background: var(--card-bg);
		border: var(--card-border);
		border-radius: var(--card-radius);
		padding: var(--card-padding);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition:
			border-color var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			box-shadow var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
			transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
	}

	.ecosystem-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-border-accent);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
		background: var(--color-surface-2);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.ecosystem-card__name {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
	}

	.ecosystem-card__desc {
		font-family: var(--font-ui);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
	}

	/* ── CTA ── */
	.about-cta {
		text-align: center;
		padding-block: var(--space-12);
		padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-8);
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-cta::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: linear-gradient(
			90deg,
			transparent,
			var(--color-border-default) 20%,
			var(--color-border-accent) 50%,
			var(--color-border-default) 80%,
			transparent
		);
	}

	/* ── Responsive ── */
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about-domains__grid,
		.about-ecosystem__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.about-hero {
			min-height: 50vh;
		}
	}
</style>
